YOUTUBE VIDEO MONTAGE RESEARCH
(60–90 second showcase per console — best of what each had to offer)
================================================================================

CONCEPT:
Each console detail page gets a short (60–90s) curated video montage showing:
- Iconic gameplay moments from that console's best games
- Historical footage or ads if no gameplay montage exists
- Ideally professionally edited compilation (not a single-game playthrough)

SEARCH STRATEGY (manual — WebFetch not available for YouTube verification):
For each console, search YouTube for:
  "[console name] best games compilation" OR
  "[console name] greatest hits" OR
  "[console name] history and games" (60-90 sec clips preferred)

TARGET VIDEO CHARACTERISTICS:
  - Duration: 60–90 seconds (or longer videos where the first 90s is relevant)
  - No commentary preferred (or subtitled)
  - High quality gameplay capture (not recorded-off-TV)
  - Shows range of genres/games, not just one franchise

IMPLEMENTATION NOTE (from existing codebase):
  The custom YouTube player is FULLY BUILT in:
    frontend/js/modules/custom-player.js
    frontend/css/components/sections.css (lines 65–570)

